EDreamUIScopeInputMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIInputServices.h#EDreamUIScopeInputMode
    src   "What a player's keys and pad do while a screen is in front: CommonUI's input modes, per navigation scope\n(UDreamUINavigationScope::InputMode), and for a player with no active scope UDreamGUISettings::InputModeWithoutScope."
    text  "当有界面前置时，玩家的按键和手柄会做什么：CommonUI 的输入模式，按导航作用域\n(UDreamUINavigationScope::InputMode) 设置；对于没有活动作用域的玩家，则使用 UDreamGUISettings::InputModeWithoutScope。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIScopeInputMode.All {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIInputServices.h#EDreamUIScopeInputMode:All
    src   "DreamGUI's built-in keys work -- navigation, confirm, Back, paging, tab switching -- and the game hears what DreamGUI does not keep: as before."
    text  "DreamGUI 内置的按键（导航、确认、返回、分页、标签切换）有效，游戏可以接收到 DreamGUI 未处理的输入。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIScopeInputMode.Game {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIInputServices.h#EDreamUIScopeInputMode:Game
    src   "Gameplay: DreamGUI's built-in navigation, confirm and Back are off for the player -- a HUD's buttons are not walked\nonto by the D-pad, nor pressed by the jump button. Bindings registered by widgets, pointers and typing still work."
    text  "游戏玩法：对玩家而言，DreamGUI 的内置导航、确认和返回均关闭——HUD 的按钮不会被\n方向键走到，也不会被跳跃键按下。由控件、指针和键入注册的绑定仍然有效。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIScopeInputMode.Menu {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIInputServices.h#EDreamUIScopeInputMode:Menu
    src   "A menu: DreamGUI's built-in keys work as with All, and the game is expected to stand down -- a project's gameplay\ninput asks UDreamUINavigationStack::GetEffectiveInputMode and ignores the player while it says Menu."
    text  "菜单：DreamGUI 的内置按键与 All 时一样工作，而游戏应当让位——项目的玩法\n输入会查询 UDreamUINavigationStack::GetEffectiveInputMode，并在其返回 Menu 时忽略玩家。"
    state machine
}
